{"text": "\"It's Jesus,\" said Papa.", "start": 153.56, "end": 155.38, "words": [{"text": "\"It's", "start": 153.56, "end": 153.86}, {"text": "Jesus,\"", "start": 153.86, "end": 154.22}, {"text": "said", "start": 154.8, "end": 155.08}, {"text": "Papa.", "start": 155.08, "end": 155.38}]},
{"text": "\"Jesus is brighter than every Christmas light.", "start": 156.16, "end": 158.84, "words": [{"text": "\"Jesus", "start": 156.16, "end": 156.42}, {"text": "is", "start": 156.42, "end": 156.8}, {"text": "brighter", "start": 156.8, "end": 157.18}, {"text": "than", "start": 157.18, "end": 157.5}, {"text": "every", "start": 157.5, "end": 158.08}, {"text": "Christmas", "start": 158.08, "end": 158.42}, {"text": "light.", "start": 158.42, "end": 158.84}]},
{"text": "When we feel sad, or a little bit scared, Jesus is right there, shining His love on us.\"", "start": 159.42, "end": 165.54, "words": [{"text": "When", "start": 159.42, "end": 159.58}, {"text": "we", "start": 159.58, "end": 159.76}, {"text": "feel", "start": 159.76, "end": 159.98}, {"text": "sad,", "start": 159.98, "end": 160.4}, {"text": "or", "start": 160.4, "end": 160.94}, {"text": "a", "start": 160.94, "end": 161.2}, {"text": "little", "start": 161.2, "end": 161.36}, {"text": "bit", "start": 161.36, "end": 161.52}, {"text": "scared,", "start": 161.52, "end": 162.0}, {"text": "Jesus", "start": 162.5, "end": 162.84}, {"text": "is", "start": 162.84, "end": 163.16}, {"text": "right", "start": 163.16, "end": 163.5}, {"text": "there,", "start": 163.5, "end": 163.88}, {"text": "shining", "start": 164.22, "end": 164.56}, {"text": "His", "start": 164.56, "end": 164.8}, {"text": "love", "start": 164.8, "end": 165.1}, {"text": "on", "start": 165.1, "end": 165.28}, {"text": "us.\"", "start": 165.28, "end": 165.54}]},
{"text": "\"Christmas is coming!\"", "start": 166.16, "end": 167.22, "words": [{"text": "\"Christmas", "start": 166.16, "end": 166.6}, {"text": "is", "start": 166.6, "end": 166.9}, {"text": "coming!\"", "start": 166.9, "end": 167.22}]},
{"text": "said Mummy.", "start": 167.54, "end": 168.02, "words": [{"text": "said", "start": 167.54, "end": 167.78}, {"text": "Mummy.", "start": 167.78, "end": 168.02}]},
{"text": "\"Tomorrow, let's shine too: one kind thing for someone in our family.\"", "start": 168.54, "end": 172.8, "words": [{"text": "\"Tomorrow,", "start": 168.54, "end": 168.86}, {"text": "let's", "start": 169.32, "end": 169.58}, {"text": "shine", "start": 169.58, "end": 169.8}, {"text": "too:", "start": 169.8, "end": 170.12}, {"text": "one", "start": 170.56, "end": 170.88}, {"text": "kind", "start": 170.88, "end": 171.12}, {"text": "thing", "start": 171.12, "end": 171.46}, {"text": "for", "start": 171.46, "end": 171.66}, {"text": "someone", "start": 171.66, "end": 172.04}, {"text": "in", "start": 172.04, "end": 172.28}, {"text": "our", "start": 172.28, "end": 172.4}, {"text": "family.\"", "start": 172.4, "end": 172.8}]},
{"text": "Ema thought hard.", "start": 173.32, "end": 174.4, "words": [{"text": "Ema", "start": 173.32, "end": 173.66}, {"text": "thought", "start": 173.66, "end": 173.96}, {"text": "hard.", "start": 173.96, "end": 174.4}]},
{"text": "\"I'll help Papa make breakfast!\"", "start": 174.94, "end": 176.26, "words": [{"text": "\"I'll", "start": 174.94, "end": 175.2}, {"text": "help", "start": 175.2, "end": 175.36}, {"text": "Papa", "start": 175.36, "end": 175.68}, {"text": "make", "start": 175.68, "end": 175.9}, {"text": "breakfast!\"", "start": 175.9, "end": 176.26}]},
{"text": "What about you, little one?", "start": 176.86, "end": 178.0, "words": [{"text": "What", "start": 176.86, "end": 177.16}, {"text": "about", "start": 177.16, "end": 177.32}, {"text": "you,", "start": 177.32, "end": 177.56}, {"text": "little", "start": 177.58, "end": 177.76}, {"text": "one?", "start": 177.76, "end": 178.0}]},
{"text": "What kind thing could you do tomorrow?", "start": 178.0, "end": 179.96, "words": [{"text": "What", "start": 178.0, "end": 178.54}, {"text": "kind", "start": 178.54, "end": 178.78}, {"text": "thing", "start": 178.78, "end": 179.06}, {"text": "could", "start": 179.06, "end": 179.28}, {"text": "you", "start": 179.28, "end": 179.48}, {"text": "do", "start": 179.48, "end": 179.62}, {"text": "tomorrow?", "start": 179.62, "end": 179.96}]},
{"text": "Oh, that will make someone smile.", "start": 183.2, "end": 185.68, "words": [{"text": "Oh,", "start": 183.2, "end": 183.78}, {"text": "that", "start": 183.92, "end": 184.38}, {"text": "will", "start": 184.38, "end": 184.64}, {"text": "make", "start": 184.64, "end": 184.82}, {"text": "someone", "start": 184.82, "end": 185.16}, {"text": "smile.", "start": 185.16, "end": 185.68}]},
{"text": "You know, little one…", "start": 188.02, "end": 189.38, "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 188.02, "end": 188.34}, {"text": "know,", "start": 188.34, "end": 188.58}, {"text": "little", "start": 188.9, "end": 189.04}, {"text": "one…", "start": 189.04, "end": 189.38}]},
{"text": "Jesus is the great light, and you can be His little light.", "start": 190.12, "end": 194.18, "words": [{"text": "Jesus", "start": 190.12, "end": 190.42}, {"text": "is", "start": 190.42, "end": 190.92}, {"text": "the", "start": 190.92, "end": 191.06}, {"text": "great", "start": 191.06, "end": 191.44}, {"text": "light,", "start": 191.44, "end": 191.82}, {"text": "and", "start": 192.34, "end": 192.56}, {"text": "you", "start": 192.56, "end": 192.82}, {"text": "can", "start": 192.82, "end": 193.06}, {"text": "be", "start": 193.06, "end": 193.24}, {"text": "His", "start": 193.24, "end": 193.44}, {"text": "little", "start": 193.44, "end": 193.74}, {"text": "light.", "start": 193.74, "end": 194.18}]},
{"text": "Every kind word, every helping hand, every gentle hug…", "start": 194.86, "end": 199.28, "words": [{"text": "Every", "start": 194.86, "end": 195.2}, {"text": "kind", "start": 195.2, "end": 195.52}, {"text": "word,", "start": 195.52, "end": 195.9}, {"text": "every", "start": 196.48, "end": 196.76}, {"text": "helping", "start": 196.76, "end": 197.12}, {"text": "hand,", "start": 197.12, "end": 197.54}, {"text": "every", "start": 198.1, "end": 198.46}, {"text": "gentle", "start": 198.46, "end": 198.88}, {"text": "hug…", "start": 198.88, "end": 199.28}]},
{"text": "that's you, shining for Jesus.", "start": 199.98, "end": 202.08, "words": [{"text": "that's", "start": 199.98, "end": 200.26}, {"text": "you,", "start": 200.26, "end": 200.54}, {"text": "shining", "start": 201.1, "end": 201.42}, {"text": "for", "start": 201.42, "end": 201.74}, {"text": "Jesus.", "start": 201.74, "end": 202.08}]},
{"text": "Ema looked at the paper candle on her window and smiled.", "start": 203.1, "end": 206.06, "words": [{"text": "Ema", "start": 203.1, "end": 203.38}, {"text": "looked", "start": 203.38, "end": 203.62}, {"text": "at", "start": 203.62, "end": 203.82}, {"text": "the", "start": 203.82, "end": 203.96}, {"text": "paper", "start": 203.96, "end": 204.22}, {"text": "candle", "start": 204.22, "end": 204.62}, {"text": "on", "start": 204.62, "end": 204.86}, {"text": "her", "start": 204.86, "end": 205.0}, {"text": "window", "start": 205.0, "end": 205.3}, {"text": "and", "start": 205.3, "end": 205.64}, {"text": "smiled.", "start": 205.64, "end": 206.06}]},
{"text": "Then they all held hands.", "start": 206.7, "end": 208.32, "words": [{"text": "Then", "start": 206.7, "end": 206.98}, {"text": "they", "start": 206.98, "end": 207.28}, {"text": "all", "start": 207.28, "end": 207.62}, {"text": "held", "start": 207.62, "end": 207.86}, {"text": "hands.", "start": 207.86, "end": 208.32}]},
{"text": "Let's pray.", "start": 209.38, "end": 209.98, "words": [{"text": "Let's", "start": 209.38, "end": 209.68}, {"text": "pray.", "start": 209.68, "end": 209.98}]},
{"text": "Dear Jesus…", "start": 210.82, "end": 211.44, "words": [{"text": "Dear", "start": 210.82, "end": 211.0}, {"text": "Jesus…", "start": 211.0, "end": 211.44}]},
{"text": "thank You for being the great light.", "start": 212.14, "end": 214.22, "words": [{"text": "thank", "start": 212.14, "end": 212.5}, {"text": "You", "start": 212.5, "end": 212.74}, {"text": "for", "start": 212.74, "end": 212.96}, {"text": "being", "start": 212.96, "end": 213.2}, {"text": "the", "start": 213.2, "end": 213.44}, {"text": "great", "start": 213.44, "end": 213.76}, {"text": "light.", "start": 213.76, "end": 214.22}]},
{"text": "Help me shine with kindness tomorrow.", "start": 214.22, "end": 216.54, "words": [{"text": "Help", "start": 214.22, "end": 214.9}, {"text": "me", "start": 214.9, "end": 215.12}, {"text": "shine", "start": 215.12, "end": 215.42}, {"text": "with", "start": 215.42, "end": 215.64}, {"text": "kindness", "start": 215.64, "end": 216.02}, {"text": "tomorrow.", "start": 216.02, "end": 216.54}]},
{"text": "Amen.", "start": 217.26, "end": 217.56, "words": [{"text": "Amen.", "start": 217.26, "end": 217.56}]},
{"text": "Goodnight, little light.", "start": 218.66, "end": 219.9, "words": [{"text": "Goodnight,", "start": 218.66, "end": 219.24}, {"text": "little", "start": 219.44, "end": 219.54}, {"text": "light.", "start": 219.54, "end": 219.9}]},
{"text": "Sleep tight.", "start": 220.4, "end": 221.06, "words": [{"text": "Sleep", "start": 220.4, "end": 220.7}, {"text": "tight.", "start": 220.7, "end": 221.06}]},
{"text": "Twenty more nights to go.", "start": 221.82, "end": 222.96, "words": [{"text": "Twenty", "start": 221.82, "end": 221.94}, {"text": "more", "start": 221.94, "end": 222.26}, {"text": "nights", "start": 222.26, "end": 222.5}, {"text": "to", "start": 222.5, "end": 222.74}, {"text": "go.", "start": 222.74, "end": 222.96}]}
]
